### Get all projects
GET http://localhost:8080/api/projects

### Get a project by ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/projects/1

### Create a project
POST http://localhost:8080/api/projects
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Customer Portal",
  "description": "Improvements to the customer self-service portal"
}

### Update a project
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/projects/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Customer Portal Redesign",
  "description": "Redesign of the customer self-service portal"
}

### Delete a project
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/projects/1
